  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Серебряный щит [Silver Shield].</strong> Серебряный щит [Silver Shield] tears shape from the Winds of Magic and forces it into a weaponized moment: bright, cold, hungry, or cruel according to the lore that birthed it.</p><p><strong>Mechanics.</strong> Casting uses action at range self spec. Targets make INT save against the caster's spell save DC; on a failed save, apply its listed activity damage.</p><blockquote><p>\"A spell is courage given a sharper name.\"<br><em>- Old World magister</em></p></blockquote>",
